{
  "summary": "This experiment tested an RNA-only model using multiprofile data with avgpool aggregation, achieving 0.5907 validation accuracy compared to the singleprofile baseline (0.4849). The result suggests multiprofile RNA encoding may improve performance, though the role of avgpool aggregation remains untested against other methods. Uncertainty persists about whether this improvement generalizes to multimodal settings or alternative aggregation strategies."
}

